### ============================================
### ORDER SERVICE - Saga Orchestration Test
### ============================================

### [1] HAPPY PATH - Tạo order thành công
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 999.99,
  "idempotencyKey": "order-test-001"
}

###

### [2] IDEMPOTENCY - Gửi lại request cũ → trả về order cũ, KHÔNG tạo mới
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 999.99,
  "idempotencyKey": "order-test-001"
}

###

### [3] SAGA ROLLBACK - Payment fail (amount > 10000) → auto compensate
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 15000.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "order-fail-payment-001"
}

###

### [4] SAGA ROLLBACK - Inventory fail (product không tồn tại)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "productId": "PROD-NOTEXIST",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 100.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "order-fail-inventory-001"
}

###

### [5] SAGA ROLLBACK - Inventory fail (hết hàng - order quá nhiều)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "productId": "PROD-001",
  "quantity": 99999,
  "unitPrice": 10.00,
  "idempotencyKey": "order-fail-stock-001"
}

###

### [6] Lấy thông tin 1 order (thay {orderId} bằng UUID thực)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{orderId}}

###

### [7] Lấy tất cả order của customer
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/customer/CUST-001

###

### ============================================
### PAYMENT SERVICE
### ============================================

### [8] Lấy thông tin payment (thay {paymentId} bằng UUID thực)
GET http://localhost:8082/api/payments/{{paymentId}}

###

### [9] Refund payment thủ công
DELETE http://localhost:8082/api/payments/{{paymentId}}/refund

###

### ============================================
### INVENTORY SERVICE
### ============================================

### [10] Reserve stock trực tiếp
POST http://localhost:8083/api/inventory/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "productId": "PROD-002",
  "quantity": 5,
  "idempotencyKey": "inv-test-001"
}

###

### [11] Release reservation (thay {reservationId} bằng UUID thực)
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/inventory/reservations/{{reservationId}}

###

### [12] Lấy thông tin reservation
GET http://localhost:8083/api/inventory/reservations/{{reservationId}}

###

### ============================================
### HEALTH CHECK
### ============================================

### [13] Health check order-service
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

###

### [14] Health check payment-service
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

###

### [15] Health check inventory-service
GET http://localhost:8083/actuator/health

###

### [16] Metrics (Prometheus)
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/prometheus

###
